; A record field vector in a defgadt constructor used to be accepted as ONE
; int field, after which `(Rect 3 4)` was "not callable" and `(Rect w h)` in a
; match "expects 1 fields, got 2".  It is an error at the definition.
(defgadt Shape [a]
  (Rect [w : int h : int] : (Shape int)))

(defn main [] : int 0)
